---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="Privacy policy" description="fibub does not collect, upload or store your files or the numbers you enter.">
  <article class="prose">
    <h1>Privacy policy</h1>
    <p class="lead">Short version: the files you open and the numbers you type into fibub stay on your device. We never receive them.</p>
    <h2>Your files and data</h2>
    <p>Every tool processes your input inside your web browser. Files you choose are read by your browser and are not uploaded to fibub or to anyone else. Results are created on your device and downloaded straight from it. Some tools may offer to remember your settings or entries in your browser's own storage on that device; you can clear this at any time by clearing your browser's site data.</p>
    <h2>What we do collect</h2>
    <p>We use Cloudflare Web Analytics to count page visits. It does not use cookies and does not track you across sites. Cloudflare, which hosts the site, also keeps standard technical logs (such as IP address and browser type) for security and to protect the site from attacks.</p>
    <h2>Advertising</h2>
    <p>fibub does not show ads today. If that changes, this page will be updated before any ads appear, and pages that handle your personal files will stay ad-free.</p>
    <h2>Your rights</h2>
    <p>Because we do not hold your files or entries, there is nothing of that kind for us to give back or delete. For any privacy question, including requests under Canada's PIPEDA, Quebec's Law 25, the UK GDPR, India's DPDP Act or similar laws, write to <a href="mailto:hello@fibub.com">hello@fibub.com</a>.</p>
    <p style="color:var(--muted);font-size:14px">Last updated 2026-11-06.</p>
  </article>
</Base>
